  1/beta(nu1, nu2) * x^(nu1-1) * (1-x)^(nu2-1) of the Beta distribution.

- New `stats.negbinompdf` implements Maple's negativebinomial function and computes the probability density function equal to
  binomial(n + x - 1, x) * p^n * (1 - p)^x.

