2.12.0 RC 2, May 25, 2018

- The `default` keyword has been removed.

- `strings.tolatin` now returns unsupported code points in its result.

- `os.fcopy` can now copy files if only a target directory is given. The function now no longer overwrites existing
  files and issues an error instead. Warning messages have been improved. The function now issues errors instead of
